--- !u!114 &1712021024372233
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1478384776120672}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 396459964a4a45a4b7cef4c9082df875, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPC
  displayName: "Madame Giry"
  title: "Box-keeper and keeper of secrets"
  tint: {r: 0.2, g: 0.2, b: 0.2, a: 1}
  lines:
  - text: "He did break it for him, sir, He broke it for him on the grand staircase, which he ran down too fast, sir, and it will be long before the poor gentleman will be able to go up it again!"
  - text: "As I'm speaking to you now, my good sir!"
  - text: "I always thought there were secrets between the ghost and M. Poligny. Anything that the ghost asked M. Poligny to do M. Poligny did. M. Poligny could refuse the ghost nothing."
  - text: "I never said that, seeing that it was myself who put the twenty-thousand francs into M. Richard's pocket. There! It's out! ... And may the ghost forgive me!"
  - text: "I beg your pardon. The envelope which M. le Directeur gave me was the one which I slipped into M."
  - text: "le Directeur's pocket, The one which I took to the ghost's box was another envelope, just like it, which the ghost gave me beforehand and which I hid up my sleeve."
